+the hang persists.  Over-allocating page-table columns was verified safe by walking
+every consumer -- the table is only indexed THROUGH top-k, which masks per row by
+cache_seqlens, so the extra columns get -inf and are never selected.  The
+sync-free idiom is established in-tree three times (triton_backend.py,
+trtllm_mha_backend.py, and DSA's own graph path).
